  characterName: Rokeya Chowdhury
  promptText: Little sister, my brand is sold as sustainable, but it runs on low
    factory wages. Raise pay and the factory may close; those mothers lose everything.
    Keep wages low, or raise them?
  leftAnswer: Keep them low for now. Protect the jobs first
  rightAnswer: Raise them. Fair pay is part of sustainable
